<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Independent Verification Worksheet</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-weight: bold; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  td, th { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border: 1px solid #ccc; }
  .form-group { margin-bottom: 15px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="float: left; margin-right: 20px;">
      <img src="placeholder_logo.png" alt="Logo" style="height: 80px;">
    </div>
    <div style="float: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">2022-2023 Independent Verification 1 Worksheet</h1>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Federal Student Aid Programs</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Your application was selected by the U.S. Dept. of Education for review process called "verification." In this process, we are required by federal law to verify information provided on the Free Application for Federal Student Aid (FAFSA). To verify this information, the IRS Tax Return Transcript is required.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">We cannot process your financial aid until verification has been completed.</p>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">1. Complete, sign and return the worksheet.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">2. Independent students who are NON-Tax Filers need to complete IRS Form 4506-T to receive a "Verification of NON-Filing" letter and submit letter to our office. Please call IRS at 1-800-898-9946 with any questions.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">3. Please use IRS Data Retrieval Tool (DRT) on your FAFSA or submit Tax Return Transcript for 2020 (IRS Form 1040, 1040A or 1040EZ are not sufficient), and any other documents requested, to our office.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">4. We will compare the information on these documents to your FAFSA and make corrections if necessary.</p>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Section A: Student Information</h2>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <th style="width: 20%;">Last Name</th>
      <th style="width: 20%;">First Name</th>
      <th style="width: 20%;">M.I.</th>
      <th style="width: 40%;"></th>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.last_name">{{ student_info.last_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.first_name">{{ student_info.first_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.middle_initial">{{ student_info.middle_initial }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 20%;">Address (include apt. #)</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">City</td>
      <td style="width: 20%;">State</td>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Zip Code</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.address">{{ student_info.address }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.city">{{ student_info.city }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.state">{{ student_info.state }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.zip_code">{{ student_info.zip_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>E-mail Address</td>
      <td>Phone Number (include area code)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.email">{{ student_info.email }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_info.phone">{{ student_info.phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Section B: Family Information (complete chart below)</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Dependent Students: List ALL people in your household, include</p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 20px; font-size: 11pt;">
    <li>Yourself</li>
    <li>Other people if they now live with you and you provide more than half of their support and will continue to provide more than half of their support from July 1, 2022 through June 30, 2023.</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Number in College</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Full Name</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">Age</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Relationship</th>
        <th style="width: 35%;">College</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in family_members %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].full_name">{{ family_members[loop.index0].full_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].age">{{ family_members[loop.index0].age }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].relationship">{{ family_members[loop.index0].relationship }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="family_members[{{ loop.index0 }}].college">{{ family_members[loop.index0].college }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Section C: Tax Form</h2>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">NOTE: All tax filers who did not use the IRS DATA Retrieval tool when completing the FAFSA must submit a copy of their 2020 IRS Tax Return Transcript. To obtain a copy of your IRS Tax Return Transcript go to <a href="http://www.irs.gov" style="color: blue;">www.irs.gov</a> OR call the IRS @ 800.908.9946.</p>

  <div class="page">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">Section D: Non Tax Filers</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">STUDENT TAX FORMS AND INCOME INFORMATION</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">1. Did the student file or will file a 2020 Federal Tax Return?</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="yes_d" name="yes_d"> <label for="yes_d">YES</label><br>
      <input type="checkbox" id="no_d" name="no_d"> <label for="no_d">NO - If no, please answer question 2.</label>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">2. Tax Return Nonfilers - complete this section if the student will not file and is not required to file a 2020 Federal Tax Return with the IRS - check the box that applies:</p>
    <div style="margin-left: 30px;">
      <input type="checkbox" id="not_employed_d" name="not_employed_d"> <label for="not_employed_d">The student was not employed and had no income earned from work in 2020</label><br>
      <input type="checkbox" id="employed_no_return_d" name="employed_no_return_d"> <label for="employed_no_return_d">The student was employed in 2020 and has listed below the names of all the student's employers and the amount earned from each employer in 2020. List every employer even if they did not issue an IRS W-2 form. If the student did not receive a W-2, submit a signed statement verifying where the student was employed in 2020 and the total amount of income that the student earned from work.</label>
    </div>

    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Provide a Letter of Non-Tax Filing from the IRS or other relevant tax authority dated on or after October 1, 2020 that indicates a 2020 income tax return was not filed with the IRS or other relevant tax authority.</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 30%;">Employer's Name</th>
          <th style="width: 30%;">Student Annual Amount Earned in 2020</th>
          <th style="width: 40%;">IRS W-2 or Equivalent Document Provided</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for item in non_tax_filer_employers %}
        <tr>
          <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_employers[{{ loop.index0 }}].employer_name">{{ non_tax_filer_employers[loop.index0].employer_name }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_employers[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount_earned">{{ non_tax_filer_employers[loop.index0].amount_earned }}</span></td>
          <td><span data-field="non_tax_filer_employers[{{ loop.index0 }}].w2_provided">{{ non_tax_filer_employers[loop.index0].w2_provided }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Section E: Additional Income Information</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">(ENTER ZEROS IF NO FUNDS WERE RECEIVED)</p>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Both tax filers and non-tax filers must list any additional income received in 2020. Failure to complete this section will delay the processing of your financial aid. Both the left side and the right side columns must be completed.</p>

    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 20%;">STUDENT</th>
          <th style="width: 40%;">CALENDAR YEAR 2020</th>
          <th style="width: 20%;"></th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>$</td>
          <td>IRA deductions and payments 2020 IRS Schedule 1 Line 15 + Line 19</td>
          <td><span data-field="additional_income.ira_deductions">{{ additional_income.ira_deductions }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>$</td>
          <td>Tax exempt interest income from 2020 IRS Form 1040 Line 2a</td>
          <td><span data-field="additional_income.tax_exempt_interest">{{ additional_income.tax_exempt_interest }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>$</td>
          <td>Untaxed portions of Individual Retirement Account (IRA) Distributions and Pensions 2020 IRS Form 1040 Lines 4a + 4c minus 4b + 4d (If negative, enter zero. Exclude rollovers)</td>
          <td><span data-field="additional_income.untaxed_ira">{{ additional_income.untaxed_ira }}</span></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>$</td>
          <td>Education Credits 2020 IRS Schedule 3 Line 3</td>
          <td><span data-field="additional_income.education_credits">{{ additional_income.education_credits }}</span></td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <h2 style="margin-top: 30px;">Section F: Sign This Worksheet</h2>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">By signing this worksheet, I (we) certify that all the information reported on this worksheet is complete and correct. If dependent, at least one parent must sign. Warning: If you purposely give false or misleading information on this worksheet, you may be fined, be sent to prison, or both. By signing, we also authorize VMI to make changes to my 2022/23 FAFSA based on documents and/or information we may have provided.</p>

    <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
      <p style="float: left; width: 45%;">Student's Signature</p>
      <p style="float: right; width: 45%;">Date</p>
    </div>
    <div style="clear: both;"></div>

    <p style="margin-top: 80px; font-size: 10pt;">Return to: VMI Financial Aid Office, 307B Letcher Avenue, Lexington, VA 24450</p>
    <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Office Number (540)-464-7208; FAX (540)-464-7629</p>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>